        {
          "_key": "k000vd",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "By late evening the center is calm. Children have had dinner at 6 pm, and they go outside when the weather allows. School-age children get homework help if they need it. The evening snack is at 9 pm and quiet time starts at 9:30 pm, so children are ready for bed when you get them home."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
